 not open a duplicate. It describes the rollback, the partial failure and the retry, and the current healthy state.\n\nFollow-up for the on-call engineer: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure and why the orchestrator halted the first rollback. Don't redeploy v2.3.1 or v2.3.1-rc until that is understood.", "type": "text"}]}]}